---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const bars = Array.from({ length: 42 }, (_, i) => (i * 7 + 3) % 5);
---

<footer class="mt-16">
  <div class="rule-heavy"></div>
  <div class="bg-[var(--color-paper-lo)]">
    <div
      class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1180px] gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"
    >
      <div class="sm:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span
            class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center border-[3px] border-[var(--color-ink)] bg-[var(--color-hero)] text-[var(--color-paper-hi)]"
          >
            <span class="display text-sm leading-none">616</span>
          </span>
          <span class="display text-xl">地球 616</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">
          主宇宙档案库。MCU 电影与英雄、几篇博客，以及一柜子还没造出来的工具。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="sticker text-xs">ISSUE 0616</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] tracking-[0.2em]"
            >SINCE 2022</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="label mb-3">本刊导航</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm font-bold">
          <li><a class="hover:text-[var(--color-hero)]" href="/archive">MCU 档案</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-[var(--color-hero)]" href="/blog">博客</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-[var(--color-hero)]" href="/armory">工具柜</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-[var(--color-hero)]" href="/rss.xml">订阅 RSS</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="label mb-3">印次信息</p>
        <div class="barcode">
          {bars.map((w) => <span style={`width:${w}px`} />)}
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.16em]">
          PRESSED IN EARTH-616
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.16em]">
          VOL.06 · NO.0616
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t-2 border-[var(--color-ink)]">
      <div
        class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1180px] flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[0.62rem] tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]"
      >
        <span>© {year} thj2333 · 保留所有宇宙的版权</span>
        <span>排版：ASTRO + 手工 CSS · 无框架暗改</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
